# Superseded: ns-netifyd-configure is now called directly by netifyd's own
# init script (start_service/reload_service), matching the real
# NethSecurity design exactly - no separate init script is needed to invoke
# it. This file previously resolved LAN/WAN devices by firewall zone for
# passive -I/-E capture, which turned out not to be how the real, original
# design achieves inline NFQUEUE capture at all - see msp/DPI_PLAN.md in
# the internal repo. Disabled, not removed: kept for reference/rollback.

START=48

start() {
	return 0
}
